OL,3,ACopper wire upgrade caused nationwide
OL,4,Aflight suspension, US transport
OL,5,Asecretary says
OL,6,
OL,7,FA nationwide US ground stop that caused
OL,8,Fthousands of flight cancellations was
OL,9,Fcaused by an issue following a copper
OL,10,Fwire upgrade, Transport Secretary Sean
OL,11,FDuffy said.
OL,13,FDuffy told a news conference that the
OL,14,Fgovernment was trying to find out
OL,15,Fwhether the problem was caused by
OL,16,F"incompetence" on the part of the
OL,17,Fcompany doing the upgrades, or faulty
OL,18,Fequipment.
OL,23,APub: 14-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/39
