OL,3,ACopper wire upgrade caused nationwide
OL,4,Aflight suspension, US transport
OL,5,Asecretary says
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe US government does not believe it
OL,8,Fwas as a result of a cyber-attack,
OL,9,Falthough an investigation is still
OL,10,Funder way, Duffy said.
OL,12,FFriday's suspension was the longest
OL,13,Fsuch incident since the 11 September
OL,14,F2001 attacks on the US and the
OL,15,Fdisruption is expected to last for
OL,16,Fdays.
OL,23,APub: 14-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/39
