OL,3,APope Leo speaks of community
OL,4,A'suffering' on visit to remote Andes
OL,5,Atown
OL,6,
OL,7,FOn a visit to an isolated Andean
OL,8,Fvillage in his former diocese, Pope Leo
OL,9,FXIV has spoken about the "suffering of
OL,10,Fthose who are forced to leave their
OL,11,Fhomeland in search of a better future",
OL,12,Fwhich he said had left communities
OL,13,Funder threat.
OL,15,FAbout 6,000 people live in Santa Cruz
OL,16,Fde Succhabamba, which is located in a
OL,17,Fremote part of the Andes mountains in
OL,18,Fnorthern Peru, but the Pope's visit
OL,19,Fdrew a crowd of about 20,000, according
OL,20,Fto the Vatican.
OL,23,APub: 15-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/39
